
Step 0: Setup (ekbar)
/system clock set time-zone-name=Asia/Dhaka
/system scheduler remove [find name~"check-"]
/system scheduler remove [find name~"daily-"]
/ip hotspot user set [find profile=Hotspot-2h] limit-uptime=0s
/ip hotspot user set [find profile=Hotspot-5min] limit-uptime=0s
 


Script 1: On Login (duita profile e same script)
[Mikrotik_CLI] /ip/hotspot/profile>


Kothay: IP > Hotspot > User Profiles > Hotspot-2h > Scripts > On Login, abar Hotspot-5min > Scripts > On Login e-o same ta boshan.
Kaj: Prothom login e comment e days:31 boshay (validity shuru). 31 dewar karon: prothom din ta adha thake, 
tai prothom raat 12 tay days:30 hobe, r user pura 30 din pabe.

///////////////////---------------------/////////////////////

:if ([/ip hotspot user get [find name=$user] comment] = "") do={
  /ip hotspot user set [find name=$user] comment="days:31"
}

///////////////////---------------------/////////////////////



Script 2: Scheduler check-daily-limit

Kaj: Din e limit (2h ba 5min) hole user ke disable kore, session kete dey, cookie muche dey.

Kothay: System > Scheduler > Add

Name: check-daily-limit
Start Time: 00:00:00
Interval: 00:00:30
On Event:

///////////////////---------------------/////////////////////

:foreach i in=[/ip hotspot user find where disabled=no] do={
  :local p [/ip hotspot user get $i profile]
  :local lim 0s
  :if ($p="Hotspot-2h") do={:set lim 02:00:00}
  :if ($p="Hotspot-5min") do={:set lim 00:05:00}
  :if ($lim > 0s) do={
    :local n [/ip hotspot user get $i name]
    :local t [/ip hotspot user get $i uptime]
    :foreach a in=[/ip hotspot active find where user=$n] do={
      :set t ($t + [/ip hotspot active get $a uptime])
    }
    :if ($t >= $lim) do={
      /ip hotspot user set $i disabled=yes
      /ip hotspot active remove [find user=$n]
      /ip hotspot cookie remove [find user=$n]
    }
  }
}


///////////////////---------------------/////////////////////

Script 3: Scheduler daily-reset

Kaj: Protidin raat 12 tay: uptime counter 0, user enable, din 1 kom, 30 din sesh hole expired (abar enable hobe na).

Kothay: System > Scheduler > Add

Name: daily-reset
Start Time: 00:00:00
Interval: 1d 00:00:00
On Event:

///////////////////---------------------/////////////////////


/ip hotspot user reset-counters [find profile="Hotspot-2h"]
/ip hotspot user reset-counters [find profile="Hotspot-5min"]
:foreach i in=[/ip hotspot user find where comment~"^days:" (profile="Hotspot-2h" || profile="Hotspot-5min")] do={
  :local c [/ip hotspot user get $i comment]
  :local d [:tonum [:pick $c 5 [:len $c]]]
  :local n [/ip hotspot user get $i name]
  :if ($d <= 1) do={
    /ip hotspot user set $i disabled=yes comment="expired"
    /ip hotspot active remove [find user=$n]
    /ip hotspot cookie remove [find user=$n]
  } else={
    /ip hotspot user set $i disabled=no comment=("days:" . ($d - 1))
  }
}


